The patient reports that her blood sugar has been running high and low. She states that she has noticed this lately. The patient continues to take her metformin. The patient reports that her blood sugars have been running around her target range. The patient states that she has been monitoring her blood pressure at home. She notes that she has been staying away from salty foods.

