The patient reports that she has been using Wixela for her asthma. She states that she only uses her albuterol inhaler on rare occasions, usually before a workout. She uses her Wixela daily, 1 puff in the morning and 1 puff at night. She notes that she has been trying to reduce her daily use of her inhaler in preparation for joining the military. She is hopeful that she will be able to enlist in the spring of 2022.

