ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

1. CHF.
• Medical Reasoning: The patient's CHF exacerbation was caused by dietary indiscretion and uncontrolled hypertension.
• Patient Education and Counseling: I advised the patient to continue on Bumex 2 mg daily. He should continue to watch his diet and avoid salty foods. He should also avoid pizza and chicken wings.
